<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12501] The AuthenticationProcessorNodeRestartTest.testConcurrentAuthorize test is flacky.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12501</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The test is flacky. &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=7463074180495175640&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TC history&lt;/a&gt;. (Success rate 76%)&lt;br/&gt;
The reason is that there is not enough check for a message about the node exit:&lt;br/&gt;
Now:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;    private boolean serverDownMessage(String text) {
        return text.contains(&quot;Failed to send message (node may have left the grid or &quot;
            + &quot;TCP connection cannot be established due to firewall issues)&quot;)
            || text.contains(&quot;Failed to send message, node left&quot;);
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But message send can be failed by follow message introduced in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7648&quot; title=&quot;Fix IGNITE_ENABLE_FORCIBLE_NODE_KILL system property.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-7648&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-7648&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;java.lang.AssertionError: Unexpected exception: Failed to send message (node left topology):
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It seems we should to add this message to the check.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
